| Operation | Time     |
| --------- | -------- |
| add()     | O(log n) |
| poll()    | O(log n) |
| peek()    | O(1)     |

| Method            | Purpose                 |
| ----------------- | ----------------------- |
| add(e) / offer(e) | Insert                  |
| poll()            | Remove highest priority |
| peek()            | View highest priority   |
| size()            | Count                   |
| isEmpty()         | Check empty             |

Custom Priority (Comparator)
class Student {
    int marks;
}
PriorityQueue<Student> pq =
    new PriorityQueue<>(
        (a, b) -> b.marks - a.marks // Max heap
    );


